Hmm, but wait, the problem has some odd punctuation and symbols like exclamation marks and question marks. Like "Janet had 22 green pens and ! 10 yellow ! pens." Maybe that's just some formatting error, but I think the numbers are still 22 and 10. Then "she bought 6 bags of ? ; ! blue pens and 2 bags of red pens." So the numbers are 6 bags of blue and 2 of red. And there were 9 pens in each blue bag and 6 in each red. So I think my calculations are correct. 

